{"title":"Silca Makes the Fastest Clog Charms","link":"https://theradavist.com/silca-clog-charms","date":1793804415000,"content":"<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/5cbeb6cf82f90d5651b582be2e8a0ededa086b8bfba52fe4f4cf9fd4a49191d4.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/12c3cb9f5e62ec095a928e961e0a2fe0ef4749844908f4581643c7b61a0484a2.jpg 640w, /media/5cbeb6cf82f90d5651b582be2e8a0ededa086b8bfba52fe4f4cf9fd4a49191d4.jpg 1800w, /media/09967307436feba1d8d64ed5cd48eaeb41f457aab7cea7cc9189708ff568a930.jpg\" /></p>\n<p><em><a href=\"https://theradavist.com/tag/silca\" target=\"_blank\">Silca</a> spent two years on research, prototyping, and wind-tunnel testing to develop the world’s most aerodynamic pair of foam slip-in clogs. Here at The Radavist, we take aerodynamic efficiency seriously. It’s no laughing matter, so please read the important details about the titanium turbulators below.</em></p>\n<p><span></span></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/6a6dc5c91bcb043a1aca92b24378acbe5307bd8107df89b96985f2f9297f0607.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/5a45ca15d95edce07db67f782b590db608522e95f25906ca7d9cc54537935812.jpg 800w, /media/2e369321ea87226bcf7c788c7e09eacd5036d5e6e501476793ee1b04e73185d2.jpg 1600w, /media/6a6dc5c91bcb043a1aca92b24378acbe5307bd8107df89b96985f2f9297f0607.jpg\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/0ec54f2e4fd54c8884fcb2b70a8e03774e3f84315676843fab09e0a655271f89.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/565d192a9dd615bc845392b77191a86474632bc49cf3ef64a0b9ae5c42353a8b.jpg 800w, /media/64b61e231c7f94c7d4d1bb0ccdb585eb228875355194ec08050fb0265b7564e9.jpg 1600w, /media/0ec54f2e4fd54c8884fcb2b70a8e03774e3f84315676843fab09e0a655271f89.jpg\" /></p>\n<h3>Titanium Turbulator Quick Hits</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Sold in packs of three</li>\n<li>12.3g of pure titanium speed</li>\n<li>Manufactured at SILCA HQ, Indianapolis, Indiana.</li>\n<li>$ 20.00</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/df2eb5755b9e8f97e89c8d954832c0ffaf35581c8783fb02adb1802e086dd00a.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/a86fdcbc4344ea48a21d86378a50a736806d27159ff014053c0d2d3918ba475e.jpg 800w, /media/df2eb5755b9e8f97e89c8d954832c0ffaf35581c8783fb02adb1802e086dd00a.jpg 1600w, /media/b6c01843ab1922686115e1f51beb54d07fff660631ad9d9cd2e2e7fd74fa843c.jpg\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/880e3428dac5c621097f09fc7e990dbca16528bd9b8c26e7adf19ced5150740e.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/ae65915d88bcfebb386455f8acd4468bcbea7a3724988607bb1801b0b50f0291.jpg 800w, /media/880e3428dac5c621097f09fc7e990dbca16528bd9b8c26e7adf19ced5150740e.jpg 1600w, /media/583365105ecd8b8c0ec4ebf32ad182751a56d955d9235e283bba43a9933a1a70.jpg\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/5f55ac4162131e406ede088d31279daae4c72695c4f8f5e605af50a594016971.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/ea76517a2f1af04a10031dd0a33fb8a7299324b8c6677a3e1b6b93ffe7c7a34a.jpg 800w, /media/5f55ac4162131e406ede088d31279daae4c72695c4f8f5e605af50a594016971.jpg 1600w, /media/5ee35591d406da38b73386c62b2daa308e63f9023b603b9edfe292b7feb4949e.jpg\" /></p>\n<h3>Aero Clogs</h3>\n<p>Silca takes marginal gains and performance seriously. After two years of relentless research, prototyping, and wind-tunnel testing, they have developed the most aerodynamic pair of foam slip-in clogs in the world. Leveraging the watt-saving technology of their Aero Socks, they utilized in-house additive manufacturing to build custom titanium turbulators. These are designed to enhance foam clog performance. The titanium turbulators introduce small vortices in the boundary layer that energize the flow and promote flow attachment further around the foot. To celebrate this engineering achievement, we are offering a 3-pack of Silca clog charms.</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/0a5ea51052b06949b9bc69dcf3dcb4abaec9ace80964101085a4a9207282cfcc.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/320ca9e7fd2898fd04ee1268fd2dff53860d9a592a4b01f69911b2434c19a8a4.jpg 800w, /media/0a5ea51052b06949b9bc69dcf3dcb4abaec9ace80964101085a4a9207282cfcc.jpg 1600w, /media/80ff9979374a4e8970b365bf06ff67ee3140a1b8aa6915c5b397a7ec5d8865ec.jpg\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/e63ee5c88485cc2738c77e2bd1178abf113921d8afecfc7244102cdb0e10e1a3.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/253b4ab4cfb4b6f8ce6bc09e0fe7e0de94b444ac20955a628bf9c213d7632811.jpg 800w, /media/e63ee5c88485cc2738c77e2bd1178abf113921d8afecfc7244102cdb0e10e1a3.jpg 1600w, /media/014090aafd13f3ee705fd1fe451e8f7a6f9ebdbbdf2e6738c6376b0e111302e9.jpg\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/db7f5bb9b4d5934c2c2b0b37b715d34c7c9e210f9bc4a53b7a0a68dde4cec7d9.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/dd294bc99c1146919a3d7150a59ef41f9956f8f95aa0610ec37f067887753353.jpg 800w, /media/db7f5bb9b4d5934c2c2b0b37b715d34c7c9e210f9bc4a53b7a0a68dde4cec7d9.jpg 1600w, /media/08e299a10bd244ada73e8400e377391ce0e47fe22c87360bfc067ce1d6a87406.jpg\" /></p>\n<p>Each set of three includes one turbulator, one Silca wordmark, and one Silca shield logo.</p>\n<p>And yes, sport mode is mandatory.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://silca.cc/products/titanium-clog-charms\" target=\"_blank\">See the aero titanium turbulator clog charms at Silca.</a></p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://theradavist.com/silca-clog-charms\">Silca Makes the Fastest Clog Charms</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://cms.theradavist.com/\">The Radavist</a>.</p>","author":"Paul Kalifatidi","comments":"https://theradavist.com/silca-clog-charms#comments","siteTitle":"The Radavist","siteHash":"96eb481d8084f04a4602bac57874ba717baf56b758f45547b5caf2312da766ef","entryHash":"2769a8cc85c8f3ad575ae878e3d484dc605ddf7c3bf298264bb2bdcbc800140f","category":"Cycling"}